# 7. Task 4 — Email Validation

Create:

```python
def validate_email(email):
    pass
```

The function should determine whether an email is valid according to these basic business rules:

### Valid Email

Must:

* Contain exactly one `@`
* Contain a `.`
* Have text before `@`
* Have text between `@` and `.`
* Have text after the final `.`

### Examples

```text
john.smith@gmail.com       VALID
sarah.khan@gmail.com       VALID
david.lee@gmail            INVALID
abc.com                    INVALID
@test.com                  INVALID
user@.com                  INVALID
```

Return:

```python
True
```

or

```python
False
```

